Q: Library &#39;swiftWebKit&#39; not found when building for physical iOS devices after upgrading Xcode — works fine on Simulator A: <p>Open your project.pbxproj file and delete the all occurrences of libswiftwebkit. Remove ALL related lines.</p>
<pre><code>        8489C9BD2B0503A500621717 /* libswiftWebKit.tbd in Frameworks */ = {isa = PBXBuildFile; fileRef = 8489C9BC2B0503A500621717 /* libswiftWebKit.tbd */; };
</code></pre>
